<title>BELGIUM: French MEP to join Green Group in New Year..</title>
<headline>French MEP to join Green Group in New Year..</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Parliament's Green Group announced on Wednesday that French MEP Noel Mamere will join the Green Group from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>This will raise the number of Green MEPs from 27 to 28. Mamere will be the Green Group's sole French MEP, raising the number of nations represented by the group from eight to nine.</p>
</text>
